{"case_id": "rb77_05", "question": "MC-6RB77A 报 U12 故障代码怎么处理？", "item_name": "Panasonic MC-6RB77A 智能吸尘器", "keyword_groups": [["U12"], ["滚刷", "边刷"], ["异物", "卡住"]], "status": "success", "answer": "当MC-6RB77A报U12故障代码时，应按照以下步骤处理：\n\n1. 检查滚刷是否卡住了。\n2. 检查边刷是否卡住了。\n3. 若发现有异物卡住，请清除卡住的异物（参考第16、18页说明）[资料1]。\n\n处理完成后，按下本体或遥控器的“开始 /停止键”以恢复正常运行[资料1]。\n\n【图片】\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-6RB77A/ae040f441b29f9793700b5274a2064c432404f0c2b9d404dc44a83a0af59a4dc.jpg>\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-6RB77A/4be70995232cdb83b9b163ec2f67d87730c5108b2f2fa11e6d8712a5b55f4291.jpg>", "sources": [{"index": 1, "title": "## 故障代码-1", "source": "468264461977660774", "score": null}, {"index": 2, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977660775", "score": null}, {"index": 3, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977660766", "score": null}, {"index": 4, "title": "## 传感器部 · 信号接收/发射窗", "source": "468264461977660769", "score": null}, {"index": 5, "title": "# 故障的判断（续）", "source": "468264461977660776", "score": null}, {"index": 6, "title": "# 故障的判断（续）", "source": "468264461977660778", "score": null}, {"index": 7, "title": "# Panasonic", "source": "468264461977660739", "score": null}, {"index": 8, "title": "# 快速使用指南（续）", "source": "468264461977660765", "score": null}, {"index": 9, "title": "## 操作部", "source": "468264461977660753", "score": null}, {"index": 10, "title": "# 故障的判断（续）-3", "source": "468264461977660777", "score": null}], "keyword_group_hits": [true, true, true], "key_fact_recall": 1.0, "citation_valid": true, "answer_pass": true, "latency_ms": 6603.75}
