{"case_id": "d56_06", "question": "MC-8D56C 的过滤网水洗后需要晾多久？", "item_name": "Panasonic MC-8D56C 充电式真空吸尘器", "keyword_groups": [["24小时", "24 小时"], ["通风"], ["吹风机", "热风"]], "status": "success", "answer": "根据参考资料，过滤网水洗后需充分干燥，但未明确说明具体晾晒时间。资料中仅提到“水洗后请充分干燥，再装回原样”以及“置于通风良好的地方大约24小时，使其完全干燥”[资料1]。\n\n因此，建议在通风良好处晾干至少24小时以确保完全干燥，避免产生异味或造成堵塞。\n\n【图片】\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-8D56C/9958719a50c4caf8ce9ec6e0f62ad74f67bbabc84c5f245e65c2d17e9e360723.jpg>\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-8D56C/4c8877d38aaff830918e8689b08392fefa3cee44842c96646a65880cb55a8071.jpg>\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-8D56C/8cb48094faedbb00713a3f1995843bab9e770cdf536d06767eabf3531fc1c42a.jpg>", "sources": [{"index": 1, "title": "# 使用上的请求 各部位名称", "source": "468264461977661536", "score": null}, {"index": 2, "title": "## 规格-1", "source": "468264461977661543", "score": null}, {"index": 3, "title": "# Panasonic", "source": "468264461977661542", "score": null}, {"index": 4, "title": "# 使用上的请求 各部位名称", "source": "468264461977661531", "score": null}, {"index": 5, "title": "# 使用上的请求 各部位名称", "source": "468264461977661535", "score": null}, {"index": 6, "title": "# 使用上的请求 各部位名称", "source": "468264461977661541", "score": null}, {"index": 7, "title": "# 使用上的请求 各部位名称", "source": "468264461977661539", "score": null}, {"index": 8, "title": "# 使用上的请求 各部位名称", "source": "468264461977661538", "score": null}, {"index": 9, "title": "# 使用上的请求 各部位名称", "source": "468264461977661530", "score": null}, {"index": 10, "title": "## 为了防止受伤等…", "source": "468264461977661522", "score": null}], "keyword_group_hits": [true, true, false], "key_fact_recall": 0.6667, "citation_valid": true, "answer_pass": false, "latency_ms": 4180.64}
{"case_id": "r76_03", "question": "MC-8R76C 哪些情况下预约打扫不会开始？", "item_name": "松下 MC-8R76C 智能吸尘器", "keyword_groups": [["正在打扫"], ["电量不足"], ["待机"]], "status": "success", "answer": "根据参考资料，MC-8R76C在以下情况下预约打扫无法开始：\n\n1. 电源开关关闭时。  \n2. 正在打扫时。  \n3. 电量不足时（状态指示灯闪烁）。  \n\n以上信息来源于资料1和资料10中的“预约”部分说明[资料1]；[资料10]。\n\n【图片】\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-8R76C/68cc2798858ca8050f6431520cf67ba724806e1a593b7cefb83458c13c20e20a.jpg>\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-8R76C/7ae4aeae00fcfd31207ccbaf96c6f7d51c0a9deb2c6d237958d28658db7d746e.jpg>", "sources": [{"index": 1, "title": "# 还能如此操作", "source": "468264461977661956", "score": null}, {"index": 2, "title": "## 打开电源开关", "source": "468264461977661946", "score": null}, {"index": 3, "title": "## 预约设定", "source": "468264461977661955", "score": null}, {"index": 4, "title": "# 使用前准备", "source": "468264461977661952", "score": null}, {"index": 5, "title": "# 使用前准备", "source": "468264461977661951", "score": null}, {"index": 6, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977661961", "score": null}, {"index": 7, "title": "# 故障的判断（续）", "source": "468264461977661965", "score": null}, {"index": 8, "title": "# 使用前准备", "source": "468264461977661948", "score": null}, {"index": 9, "title": "# 使用前准备", "source": "468264461977661950", "score": null}, {"index": 10, "title": "# 故障的判断（续）", "source": "468264461977661963", "score": null}], "keyword_group_hits": [true, true, false], "key_fact_recall": 0.6667, "citation_valid": true, "answer_pass": false, "latency_ms": 2835.73}
{"case_id": "r76_04", "question": "MC-8R76C 的拖布能湿用吗？", "item_name": "松下 MC-8R76C 智能吸尘器", "keyword_groups": [["干湿两用", "湿用"], ["不会滴水", "拧干"], ["平坦"]], "status": "success", "answer": "MC-8R76C 的拖布组件可湿用，但使用时需将拖布拧干至不会滴水[资料1]。", "sources": [{"index": 1, "title": "# 还能如此操作", "source": "468264461977661953", "score": null}, {"index": 2, "title": "## 请勿错误操作", "source": "468264461977661936", "score": null}, {"index": 3, "title": "# Panasonic", "source": "468264461977661930", "score": null}, {"index": 4, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977661960", "score": null}, {"index": 5, "title": "# 安全注意事项（续）", "source": "468264461977661942", "score": null}, {"index": 6, "title": "# 故障的判断（续）", "source": "468264461977661968", "score": null}, {"index": 7, "title": "# 还能如此操作", "source": "468264461977661956", "score": null}, {"index": 8, "title": "# Panasonic", "source": "468264461977661933", "score": null}, {"index": 9, "title": "# Panasonic", "source": "468264461977661934", "score": null}, {"index": 10, "title": "# 安全注意事项（续）", "source": "468264461977661941", "score": null}], "keyword_group_hits": [true, true, false], "key_fact_recall": 0.6667, "citation_valid": true, "answer_pass": false, "latency_ms": 790.44}
{"case_id": "ca78_01", "question": "MC-CA781 吸尘器为什么会自动停机约 60 分钟？", "item_name": "MC-CA781_MC-CA783 吸尘器", "keyword_groups": [["过热"], ["60分钟", "60 分钟"], ["堵塞", "过滤网"]], "status": "success", "answer": "MC-CA781 吸尘器在以下状态下会自动停机约60分钟（根据周围温度不同，停止时间可能不同）：\n\n- 清理垃圾或清洁过滤网灯亮时  \n- 吸入口被堵塞时  \n- 软管、延长管内堵塞了垃圾时  \n\n这是为了防止马达过热，保护装置启动所致[资料1]。", "sources": [{"index": 1, "title": "# 安全注意事项 请务必遵守", "source": "468264461977662629", "score": null}, {"index": 2, "title": "# 安全注意事项 请务必遵守", "source": "468264461977662630", "score": null}, {"index": 3, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662642", "score": null}, {"index": 4, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662644", "score": null}, {"index": 5, "title": "## 扫除高手， 处处干净！ 让打扫变得轻松愉快", "source": "468264461977662623", "score": null}, {"index": 6, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662638", "score": null}, {"index": 7, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662640", "score": null}, {"index": 8, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662643", "score": null}, {"index": 9, "title": "## 请勿错误操作", "source": "468264461977662625", "score": null}, {"index": 10, "title": "# 安全注意事项 请务必遵守", "source": "468264461977662633", "score": null}], "keyword_group_hits": [true, true, true], "key_fact_recall": 1.0, "citation_valid": true, "answer_pass": true, "latency_ms": 1260.47}
{"case_id": "ca78_07", "question": "MC-CA781 的褶状过滤网清洗后要干燥多久？", "item_name": "MC-CA781_MC-CA783 吸尘器", "keyword_groups": [["24小时", "24 小时"], ["通风"], ["吹风机", "热风"]], "status": "success", "answer": "根据参考资料，MC-CA781吸尘器的褶状过滤网清洗后，应在通风良好的地方充分干燥，干燥时间标准为大致需要1天（24小时）。若放在向阳处，可以干燥得更快。[资料1][资料5]\n\n【图片】\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-CA781_MC-CA783/536d2ce733e862336092b984ecd96396fc51ebafbe48609addb8d5cb98a82539.jpg>\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-CA781_MC-CA783/fec1e95ebbec020e3bb451f20643dc127f31699ae089115eb28ec93d38b6b1d2.jpg>", "sources": [{"index": 1, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662640", "score": null}, {"index": 2, "title": "## 集尘盒", "source": "468264461977662639", "score": null}, {"index": 3, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662641", "score": null}, {"index": 4, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662642", "score": null}, {"index": 5, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662637", "score": null}, {"index": 6, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662635", "score": null}, {"index": 7, "title": "# 安全注意事项 请务必遵守", "source": "468264461977662629", "score": null}, {"index": 8, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662638", "score": null}, {"index": 9, "title": "# 安全注意事项 请务必遵守", "source": "468264461977662633", "score": null}, {"index": 10, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662636", "score": null}], "keyword_group_hits": [true, true, false], "key_fact_recall": 0.6667, "citation_valid": true, "answer_pass": false, "latency_ms": 2851.81}
{"case_id": "ca78_08", "question": "MC-CA783 旋转毛刷不转应该检查什么？", "item_name": "MC-CA781_MC-CA783 吸尘器", "keyword_groups": [["线绳", "缠绕"], ["地面吸嘴", "垃圾"], ["浮起", "地板"]], "status": "success", "answer": "MC-CA783 旋转毛刷不转时，应按照以下步骤检查：\n\n1. 检查旋转部（毛刷）是否缠绕了线绳等垃圾。若有，需清除缠绕物[资料3]。\n2. 检查地面吸嘴中是否堵塞了垃圾。如有堵塞，应清理干净[资料1]。\n3. 确认是否在吸尘长毛地毯等特殊材质时使用，因地毯种类不同可能导致毛刷转动变慢或不转[资料1]。\n4. 确保地面吸嘴未从地板上浮起，因为当吸嘴离开地面时，为安全起见，旋转部会自动停止运转[资料4]。\n\n【图片】\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-CA781_MC-CA783/7429ae3db40b2e0ac48f18ef4d381772517cb7ca4d6f6af18ca81cd622a01a25.jpg>\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-CA781_MC-CA783/012e976a344c163a8ee6e75b8c4e79b6949b40784dd68e05871c89a62fde10ba.jpg>\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-CA781_MC-CA783/1eba6da48cff72cb8d7864a0a8e08f6e37bec8db447cb0800b562d3c91fe947a.jpg>\n<http://192.168.10.150:9000/knowledge-base-v2/MC-CA781_MC-CA783/d08be74dcac6546b54ff9a1e18aab292ed27fb3d631a2938946420d2dccf253a.jpg>", "sources": [{"index": 1, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662643", "score": null}, {"index": 2, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662642", "score": null}, {"index": 3, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662635", "score": null}, {"index": 4, "title": "# 安全注意事项 请务必遵守", "source": "468264461977662630", "score": null}, {"index": 5, "title": "# 安全注意事项 请务必遵守", "source": "468264461977662629", "score": null}, {"index": 6, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662638", "score": null}, {"index": 7, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662641", "score": null}, {"index": 8, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662636", "score": null}, {"index": 9, "title": "# 维护保养", "source": "468264461977662640", "score": null}, {"index": 10, "title": "# 安全注意事项 请务必遵守", "source": "468264461977662633", "score": null}], "keyword_group_hits": [true, true, true], "key_fact_recall": 1.0, "citation_valid": true, "answer_pass": true, "latency_ms": 5244.49}
